      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"I could. But why ought I? Your curiosity has reached out for a font of knowledge and power that few could grasp, much less master. You yearn for something that is likely beyond you. Why ought I waste my time upon one who is unworthy? We were greater, once, we who made the very galaxy tremble at our coming. Now, we are children chasing in the shadows of old masters. I shall not diluted what little we have with the unworthy. Come back when you have proven yourself otherwise.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
